OL,3,GNEWSAFamily praise 'loving' dad killed
OL,4,Ain Wavertree crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died following
OL,7,Fa collision in Liverpool has described
OL,8,Fhim as a "devoted husband" and "loving
OL,9,Ffather".
OL,11,FSuliman Zerbiga, 53, died after a
OL,12,Fcollision involving a pedestrian and
OL,13,Ftwo vehicles on Smithdown Road in
OL,14,FWavertree at about 18:50 GMT on 19
OL,15,FNovember.
OL,17,FEmergency services attended the scene
OL,18,Fbut Mr Zerbiga, from Liverpool, was
OL,19,Fpronounced dead.
